      "title": "Setup and model downloads",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 Reference Q8 Paged \u2014 experimental\n\nUse genuine [MiniMax H3 Ref2VA weights](https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3). Convert with scripts/convert_mixed_checkpoint.py --profile q8_extended, then scripts/convert_paged_checkpoint.py. Place pages in ComfyUI/models/MiniMax-H3/transformers/ref2va-q8-extended-paged. Never substitute FL2VA pages.\n\nConvert the compact Qwen encoder with scripts/convert_paged_text_encoder.py --include-vision and its full architecture config. Place it in ComfyUI/models/MiniMax-H3/text_encoders/q8-vision-paged. The existing text-only v1 export cannot encode references. Keep processor/tokenizer and VAE paths as shown.\n\nSelect one image and write a complete reference prompt. Queue the workflow after H3 Preflight succeeds. For a second reference, chain another H3 Reference Image before Reference Encode.\n\nFive seconds, 640\u00d7384, 19 dense evaluations, staged unloading. 26GB is an estimate budget, not an enforced memory limit or a measured 36GB guarantee. More/larger references increase workspace. Preview weights are optional; configure the Preview Override to match your installation.\n\nFor Studio/headless use scripts/prepare_h3_reference_recipe.py."
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#15202b"
    }
